OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fwith some clear spells at first this
OL,7,Fevening, but becoming overcast towards
OL,8,Fmidnight with outbreaks of rain or
OL,9,Fdrizzle arriving from the east. Less
OL,10,Fcold than last night. Light winds but
OL,11,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FRather cloudy with spells of
OL,14,Flight rain or drizzle, especially
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. Likely becoming
OL,16,Fdrier by the evening with a few clear
OL,17,Fspells, but further rain overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
